flowchart TB
  START([investigator node]) --> DISC[discover tools<br/>cached per token]
  DISC --> MODE{LLM enabled?}
  MODE -->|yes| LLMCALL[model.bind_tools · invoke<br/>record tokens + cost]
  MODE -->|no / LLM error| SCRIPT[scripted plan step]
  LLMCALL --> COST{cost ≥ $0.50?}
  COST -->|yes| STOPC[stop: cost_cap]
  COST -->|no| ANY{tool calls in reply?}
  SCRIPT --> ANY
  ANY -->|no| STOPD[stop: done]
  ANY -->|yes| TOOLS([tools node])
  TOOLS --> ALLOW[allowed = 8 − used]
  ALLOW --> RUN[run allowed calls in parallel<br/>span execute_tool per call]
  ALLOW --> SKIP[answer the rest 'skipped'<br/>stop: step_cap]
  RUN --> SAN[sanitize: PII → injection<br/>wrap untrusted_tool_output]
  SAN --> EVD[evidence from tool output]
  EVD --> CAP{used ≥ 8?}
  CAP -->|yes| STOPS[stop: step_cap]
  CAP -->|no| START
  STOPC & STOPD & STOPS & SKIP --> TRI([triage → rca])
